<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;i&gt;Is there any built-in without a prototype?&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;On 5.28, [doc://prototype] returns &lt;c&gt;undef&lt;/c&gt; for at least the following (I may have missed a few, and I omitted most things that I think most people would classify as keywords and operators instead of functions, like &lt;c&gt;use&lt;/c&gt;, &lt;c&gt;goto&lt;/c&gt;, and [doc://-X]):&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;c&gt;
chomp
chop
defined
delete
do
eval
exec
exists
grep
map
print
printf
require
return
say
select
sort
split
system
&lt;/c&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;small&gt;&lt;i&gt;Added minor clarifications.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;small&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</doctext>
